{
  "id": "RLSA-2026:88164",
  "title": "Important: flute, libbase, libfonts, libformula, liblayout, libloader, libreoffice, librepository, libserializer, pentaho-libxml, pentaho-reporting-flow-engine, and sac security, bug fix, and enhancement update",
  "issued": {
    "date": "2026-10-23 06:42:37"
  },
  "updated": {
    "date": "2026-10-23 12:16:10"
  },
  "severity": "Important",
  "description": "SAC is a standard interface for CSS parsers, intended to work with CSS1, CSS2, CSS3 and other CSS derived languages.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* libreoffice: heap buffer overflow in PDF import stream handling (CVE-2026-63274)\n\n* libreoffice: stack buffer overflow in CFF to Type 1 font conversion (CVE-2026-63276)\n\n* libreoffice: stack buffer overflow in CFF font hint handling (CVE-2026-63275)\n\n* libreoffice: libreoffice: Arbitrary code execution via remote Java database driver (CVE-2026-63277)\n\nBug Fix(es) and Enhancement(s):\n\n* [libbase] LibreOffice packages using EOL Java (after November 2026) (JIRA:Rocky Linux-275415)\n\n* [flute] LibreOffice packages using EOL Java (after November 2026) (JIRA:Rocky Linux-275416)\n\n* [libserializer] LibreOffice packages using EOL Java (after November 2026) (JIRA:Rocky Linux-275417)\n\n* [libloader] LibreOffice packages using EOL Java (after November 2026) (JIRA:Rocky Linux-275418)\n\n* [libformula] LibreOffice packages using EOL Java (after November 2026) (JIRA:Rocky Linux-275419)\n\n* [librepository] LibreOffice packages using EOL Java (after November 2026) (JIRA:Rocky Linux-275420)\n\n* [libfonts] LibreOffice packages using EOL Java (after November 2026) (JIRA:Rocky Linux-275421)\n\n* [liblayout] LibreOffice packages using EOL Java (after November 2026) (JIRA:Rocky Linux-275422)\n\n* [pentaho-libxml] LibreOffice packages using EOL Java (after November 2026) (JIRA:Rocky Linux-275423)\n\n* [pentaho-reporting-flow-engine] LibreOffice packages using EOL Java (after November 2026) (JIRA:Rocky Linux-275424)\n\n* [sac] LibreOffice packages using EOL Java (after November 2026) (JIRA:Rocky Linux-277813)\n\n* [libreoffice] LibreOffice packages using EOL Java (after November 2026) (JIRA:Rocky Linux-260518)\n\n* [Rocky Linux 8.10] Base Report Wizard fails with packaged Pentaho reporting engine (JIRA:Rocky Linux-286491)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
